{"seq":2,"slug":"image-watermarking","title":"图像与多模态水印","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/watermarking/image-watermarking","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图像与多模态水印\">图像与多模态水印</h1><p>文本水印靠偏置离散 token 分布，图像生成却是在连续像素空间里完成的，水印必须藏进人眼看不见、却能被算法稳定提取的地方。2023 年以来出现了两条截然不同的技术路线：一条把水印焊进扩散模型的解码器权重（Stable Signature），另一条把指纹藏进生成起点的随机噪声里（Tree-Ring），再加上 Google 已宣称做到互联网规模的 SynthID-Image。这一篇讲清这些像素级水印怎么嵌、怎么提，并厘清一个被频繁混淆的边界——像素水印与 C2PA 那样的元数据溯源根本不是一回事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-后处理水印-vs-生成内嵌水印\">核心概念：后处理水印 vs 生成内嵌水印</h2><p>先建立最重要的分类：水印是在图像生成「之后」叠上去，还是在生成「之中」长出来。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>后处理水印（post-hoc）</strong>：图像照常生成，再用一个独立模型把不可见信号编码进像素，如经典的 DwtDct、或深度学习的 HiDDeN。优点是与任何生成器解耦、可给存量图像加水印；缺点是水印与图像内容「两张皮」，更易被再生成攻击整体抹掉。</li>\n<li><strong>生成内嵌水印（in-generation）</strong>：水印在扩散采样过程中就成为图像的一部分，与语义内容纠缠，更难无损去除。Stable Signature 与 Tree-Ring 都属此类。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[图像水印路线] --&gt; B[后处理]&#10;  A --&gt; C[生成内嵌]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[独立编码器叠加信号&lt;br/&gt;可加存量图]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[Stable Signature&lt;br/&gt;改解码器权重]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[Tree-Ring&lt;br/&gt;初始噪声傅里叶相位]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[SynthID-Image&lt;br/&gt;互联网规模部署]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[与语义纠缠 更难去除]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[图像水印路线] --&gt; B[后处理]\n  A --&gt; C[生成内嵌]\n  B --&gt; B1[独立编码器叠加信号&lt;br/&gt;可加存量图]\n  C --&gt; C1[Stable Signature&lt;br/&gt;改解码器权重]\n  C --&gt; C2[Tree-Ring&lt;br/&gt;初始噪声傅里叶相位]\n  C --&gt; C3[SynthID-Image&lt;br/&gt;互联网规模部署]\n  C1 --&gt; D[与语义纠缠 更难去除]\n  C2 --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"stable-signature-把水印写进解码器\">Stable Signature：把水印写进解码器</h2><p>Stable Signature（Meta，2023）的思路是给扩散模型的 VAE 解码器做一次微调，让它产出的每一张图都天然带有一个固定的二进制签名。训练时联合优化两个目标：图像质量（感知损失，保证水印不可见）与水印可提取性（一个预训练的提取网络要能从输出图里读回目标比特串）。</p>\n<p>提取端是一个固定的解码网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>，对任意图像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 输出一个比特串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{m}=E(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。检测就是比对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与目标签名 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的匹配位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，在无水印零假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 服从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Binomial</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Binomial}(k, 0.5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Binomial</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为比特数），用尾概率给出 p 值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>p-value</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>0.5</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{p-value} = \\sum_{i=M}^{k}\\binom{k}{i}\\,0.5^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">p-value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>匹配位数显著高于一半即判定带水印。它的妙处是不同用户可以用不同签名微调各自的解码器，从而把图像追溯到具体的模型实例或客户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tree-ring-把指纹藏进初始噪声\">Tree-Ring：把指纹藏进初始噪声</h2><p>Tree-Ring（2023）走了一条更隐蔽的路。扩散模型从一团高斯噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出发逐步去噪成图像；Tree-Ring 在生成前，把一个同心圆环状的图案嵌进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的傅里叶频域相位里。这个图案在空间域上完全不可见，但生成出的图像保留了它的频域结构。检测时，对图像做扩散反演（DDIM inversion）近似还原出初始噪声，再在傅里叶域里找那圈环——找到即判带水印。</p>\n<p>Tree-Ring 的优点是对常见变换（缩放、JPEG 压缩、裁剪、轻度编辑）相当稳健，因为环形图案是旋转/平移近似不变的低频结构。但它也暴露出尖锐弱点：研究表明对频域相位做扰动会在空间域诱导一个平移，从而在几乎不改变观感的前提下破坏环形信号；NeurIPS 2024 隐形水印去除挑战赛的冠军方案正是用扩散净化加针对性扰动批量击穿了这类水印。这些攻击细节归 <a href=\"watermark-robustness\">水印鲁棒性与攻击</a> 详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"synthid-image-与统一检测\">SynthID-Image 与统一检测</h2><p>Google 的 SynthID-Image 是这条线上最具规模的部署。它给 Imagen、以及经 Google 工具生成的图像嵌入对人眼不可见、对常见编辑稳健的水印，据 2025 年公开材料宣称已做到「互联网规模」的嵌入与检测。配合 2025 年 5 月发布的统一 SynthID Detector，文本、图像、音频、视频可在同一界面验证。这与 <a href=\"llm-watermarking\">LLM 文本水印</a> 里的 SynthID-Text 同属一个产品家族，体现了厂商把水印做成跨模态基础设施的意图。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>嵌入位置</th>\n<th>抗常规编辑</th>\n<th>抗再生成</th>\n<th>部署规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后处理（HiDDeN 等）</td>\n<td>像素残差</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stable Signature</td>\n<td>解码器权重</td>\n<td>中强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>开源/研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree-Ring</td>\n<td>初始噪声频域</td>\n<td>强（几何变换）</td>\n<td>弱（净化可破）</td>\n<td>研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SynthID-Image</td>\n<td>生成内嵌</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>互联网规模（Google）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"像素水印-c2pa-元数据溯源\">像素水印 ≠ C2PA 元数据溯源</h2><p>这是本篇最该记住的一条边界，混淆它会导致严重误判。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>像素级水印</strong>是把信号编进图像内容本身，转码、截图、社交平台压缩后仍可能存活，但它能携带的信息极少（通常几十比特），且面对蓄意去除并不可靠。</li>\n<li><strong>C2PA 内容凭证</strong>是把「谁、用什么、做过哪些编辑」写进一份数字签名的元数据清单，附在文件外层。它信息丰富、密码学不可篡改，但极其脆弱——任何一次截图、转码或上传剥离元数据的平台都会让它整段消失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二者是互补而非替代：水印负责「内容被剥离元数据后仍留一点痕迹」，C2PA 负责「元数据在场时提供可验证的完整来源链」。成熟方案两者并用，详见 <a href=\"../practice/provenance-c2pa\">溯源与 C2PA 标准</a>。把「图有 C2PA 签名」当成「图有不可去除水印」，或反之，都是常见且危险的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图像水印分后处理（与生成器解耦、可加存量图、易被再生成抹除）与生成内嵌（与语义纠缠、更难去除）两类。</li>\n<li>Stable Signature 微调 VAE 解码器让输出天然带可提取签名，用二项尾概率给 p 值，可追溯到模型实例。</li>\n<li>Tree-Ring 把环形图案藏进初始噪声的傅里叶相位，抗几何变换但可被频域相位扰动与扩散净化击穿。</li>\n<li>SynthID-Image 宣称互联网规模部署并接入统一检测器；像素水印与 C2PA 元数据溯源是互补的两层，绝不可混为一谈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>文本模态的对应方案与 SynthID 家族：<a href=\"llm-watermarking\">LLM 文本水印</a></li>\n<li>针对这些水印的攻击：<a href=\"watermark-robustness\">水印鲁棒性与攻击</a></li>\n<li>元数据溯源的另一层：<a href=\"../practice/provenance-c2pa\">溯源与 C2PA 标准</a></li>\n<li>深度伪造检测的治理视角：<a href=\"../../ai-ethics-governance/societal-impact/deepfake-detection\">deepfake 检测</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图像与多模态水印","id":"图像与多模态水印"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：后处理水印 vs 生成内嵌水印","id":"核心概念-后处理水印-vs-生成内嵌水印"},{"level":2,"text":"Stable Signature：把水印写进解码器","id":"stable-signature-把水印写进解码器"},{"level":2,"text":"Tree-Ring：把指纹藏进初始噪声","id":"tree-ring-把指纹藏进初始噪声"},{"level":2,"text":"SynthID-Image 与统一检测","id":"synthid-image-与统一检测"},{"level":2,"text":"像素水印 ≠ C2PA 元数据溯源","id":"像素水印-c2pa-元数据溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 文本水印","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/watermarking/llm-watermarking"},"next":{"title":"水印鲁棒性与攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-content-detection-watermarking/watermarking/watermark-robustness"}}